<title>POLAND: BIG 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 4.64 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 4.64 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.64 vs    5.84</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    4.64 vs    5.84</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.23 vs   33.48</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	33.49 vs   54.60</p>
<p>OCTOBER-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 13.93 vs   20.84</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   13.93 vs   20.84</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  9.82 vs  101.78</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	95.27 vs  158.19</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA. Its current fiscal year ends September 30,</p>
<p>1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
